/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:177:| `mlp_seed` | `int64` | Per-MLP seed exposed in the dataset. Under seed_protocol 3.0 (`whestbench_explicit_per_mlp_seeds`), this is the **input** seed for the MLP — `MLP.seed` (the estimator seed) is derived locally. Under seed_protocol 2.0 (`whestbench_seedsequence_hierarchy`, legacy), this is the **derived** estimator seed itself. Estimators read `mlp.seed` and see the same kind of value in both protocols (a deterministic int derived from the dataset's seed material). |
